{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>在《美食新聞報道》中，節目分為兩節帶領觀眾品嚐不同異國風味。第一節由居港韓國人李明憲（Aki）帶領伍倩彤（Gillian）品嚐充滿地道韓式風味的中華料理。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_547c49d64deecc7a-935\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>率先登場的是韓國經典國民美食「韓式炸醬麵」，品嚐時必須大口「嗦」麵才算正宗地道。源自中國山東炒碼麵的「韓式辣海鮮湯麵」，其湯底匯聚了洋蔥、魷魚、蝦及蜆等豐富食材，配上口感極致彈牙的拉麵，吸滿酸辣濃郁的湯汁十分惹味。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_547c49d64deecc7a-935\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_547c49d64deecc7a-935\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>「糖醋肉」則與配料固定且常加新鮮鳳梨的中式咕嚕肉不同，展現出極少使用鮮鳳梨的獨特韓式醬汁風味。最後呈獻的「忌廉蝦」極具創意，撒滿香脆杏仁碎，蝦肉肉質厚實且新鮮彈牙，口感層次豐富。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_547c49d64deecc7a-935\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_547c49d64deecc7a-935\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>Noodle Town</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_547c49d64deecc7a-935\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>上環永樂街28號地舖</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_547c49d64deecc7a-935\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"059cc446-c1a5-43d4-83c5-4074f6b5bfda.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026aW3T00q8tF1788317959.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"059cc446-c1a5-43d4-83c5-4074f6b5bfda.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"70f65572-1176-470b-97cd-2a870d517ff3.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026jpBBuuncUI1788317958.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"70f65572-1176-470b-97cd-2a870d517ff3.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d56629c8-c74c-446b-9a4f-b5e1b192d15d.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20263pSJsYYsZO1788317958.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d56629c8-c74c-446b-9a4f-b5e1b192d15d.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a92ecb3e-986e-4cc7-ba20-e4a1a93fe0c6.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20265kVlJmdycL1788317958.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a92ecb3e-986e-4cc7-ba20-e4a1a93fe0c6.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_547c49d64deecc7a-935\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_547c49d64deecc7a-936\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>第二節則由黃嘉雯與胡美貽接棒，探訪一間充滿度假風情的隱世餐廳，一次過品嚐泰、越、印多國美食。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_547c49d64deecc7a-936\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_547c49d64deecc7a-937\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>開胃前菜首推「泰北青檸汁蒸豬頸肉」，酸辣交織的調味非常提神，相比傳統煎炸做法更加肉嫩多汁。招牌「原個椰青咖哩海鮮」將濃郁泰式咖哩盛載於新鮮椰青內，融合自然椰香與海鮮鮮甜，搭配由傳統饢坑窯爐高溫烘烤、口感柔軟而有嚼勁的「原味印度烤餅」。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_547c49d64deecc7a-937\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_547c49d64deecc7a-937\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>「印度咖哩羊肉」運用重香料與微辣調味完美去除羊羶味，濃郁惹味，重口味愛好者不容錯過。最後少不了賣相精緻的甜品，包括「椰青大菜糕」、「斑蘭蝶豆花大菜糕」及「泰式奶茶大菜糕」，兼備視覺與味覺享受。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_547c49d64deecc7a-937\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_547c49d64deecc7a-937\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>旦王花- 泰越鍾情</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_547c49d64deecc7a-937\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>元朗錦上路148號地舖</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_547c49d64deecc7a-937\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2408e2f1-9813-484e-accf-7e96b1e91942.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026l8kIeTX9mT1788317960.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2408e2f1-9813-484e-accf-7e96b1e91942.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ba21425e-043f-4928-ab6f-a59587580cf8.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026NaVenKIrbx1788317960.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ba21425e-043f-4928-ab6f-a59587580cf8.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d8151b19-2a76-4a0c-a7ee-521a5efff674.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026BqyxMRX23z1788317960.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d8151b19-2a76-4a0c-a7ee-521a5efff674.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"0643111f-3bb4-42cc-adf9-cad3c6d5678e.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026aF1RA8jjY51788317959.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0643111f-3bb4-42cc-adf9-cad3c6d5678e.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T14:24:10.062311+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":582,"images":8,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}